      },
      "title": "首次启动与热池领取（按模板）",
      "type": "row",
      "id": 101
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "所选时间范围内，从控制器首次观察 Claim 到首次 Ready 的平均耗时，不是 API 请求耗时，也不是 resume 耗时。使用直方图增量；没有观测增量时显示无样本，不补零。首次出现的时间序列及低流量窗口可能无法完整计入最初样本。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "#3987e5",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "窗口内无样本",
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_sum{launch_type=\"cold\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range])) / (sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_count{launch_type=\"cold\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "首次冷启动",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "首次冷启动平均耗时",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "所选时间范围内，从控制器首次观察 Claim 到首次 Ready 的平均耗时，不是 API 请求耗时，也不是 resume 耗时。使用直方图增量；没有观测增量时显示无样本，不补零。首次出现的时间序列及低流量窗口可能无法完整计入最初样本。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "#d95926",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "窗口内无样本",
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_sum{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range])) / (sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_count{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "热池领取",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "热池首次领取平均耗时",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "所选时间范围内，首次热池领取耗时超过 1 秒的观测增量。它不表示内存恢复，也不能单独证明热池耗尽；调度、就绪和控制器延迟等都可能影响耗时。Prometheus 增量是采样外推值，不是精确审计计数。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "窗口内无样本",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#fab219",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_count{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range])) - sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_bucket{launch_type=\"warm\", le=~\"1000(\\\\.0)?\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "超过 1 秒",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "热池领取慢请求 (>1s)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "所选模板在集群中由 SandboxWarmPool 持有且 Ready 的 Sandbox 数量。这是当前值，不是时间范围内的领取次数；不受资源命名空间筛选影响。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#fab219",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(agent_sandboxes{owned_by=\"SandboxWarmPool\", ready_condition=\"true\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "待命",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "热池待命沙箱",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "滑动窗口内首次就绪耗时的平均值，单位毫秒。窗口内没有启动增量时留空；不包含 pause/resume。峰值只能说明领取变慢，不能单独归因为热池容量不足。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "axisSoftMax": 5000,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 8,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "冷启动"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "#3987e5",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "热启动"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "#d95926",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_sum{launch_type=\"cold\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_count{launch_type=\"cold\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "首次冷启动",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_sum{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_count{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "热池首次领取",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "首次冷启动 / 热池领取耗时趋势",
