    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "title": "分布与存量（按模板）",
      "type": "row",
      "id": 102
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "首次热池领取耗时的分桶增量，不包含 resume。保留零值时间点以显示稀疏样本，零值本身不着色。最小桶为 100ms，不能细分桶内耗时；样本较少时可缩短时间范围查看。增量是 Prometheus 的外推估计，不是精确事件次数。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 2,
        "color": {
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "fill": "#d95926",
          "min": 0,
          "mode": "scheme",
          "reverse": false,
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "steps": 64
        },
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 1e-9
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (le) (increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_bucket{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__rate_interval])) and on () (sum(increase(agent_sandbox_claim_controller_startup_latency_ms_count{launch_type=\"warm\", sandbox_template=~\"$template\"}[$__range] @ end())) > 0)",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "热池首次领取耗时分布",
      "type": "heatmap"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
